  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Dominic Grasso. I'm calling about the plow, and I promise I'm not here to yell at anybody. I'm too old to yell, it takes too much out of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. What happened with the plow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it came down my street after that snow-to-rain storm, Sunday into Monday, and it left a wall of snow across the end of my driveway. Heavy stuff, too, because it got rained on and then froze up. I'm at 77 Marsh Street, in the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 77 Marsh Street, plow berm at the end of the driveway. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'd also like some sand, if you do that. The whole apron is ice. My savings account paid me a little interest this quarter, so I figure I'm rich enough to slip and fall in style, but I'd rather not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put in the sand request for Marsh Street. Best number to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:24:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0195."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:24:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, I've got that down. A crew will get to it as they can. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-28T12:24:15-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Thanks, Kevin."
    }
  ],
